+# Zentral Extended 3.0.0
+
+Original reference: Zentral 1.1.0 (`0e18990c0bfa2563d22de8f5d04135da186ef1b0`).
+
+- Reorganized into `loader/`, `zentral/`, `extension/` and `additional/`, with local documentation. Common services and independent features start separately from Apps/Groups dependencies.
+- Added a versioned compatibility bridge and documented base APIs for panel identity, app URL writes and presentation state. Preserved the existing Extended browser, startup, group and container hardening.
+- Added persistent per-app placement, optional workspace/global scopes, eight-direction detached resize, snapping previews, selectable off-window overflow, temporary pin behavior and Reset position menus. Triple View moves together; Super Pin retains independent placement. Classic Extended geometry remains available.
+- Added upstream-inspired split pill layout with the classic option, optional Detach/Move/Mobile/Save controls, browser-specific Reload/Stop and a focus-scoped panel URL shortcut.
+- Added an explicit saved start-URL action. Primary normal apps update; Essential/tab-linked and secondary panels create independent launchers.
+- Added selectable browser/content/system/manual light-dark policy and contrast options, retaining custom Extended appearance.
+- Added subtitles below the video, inspired by Zenslop's separate caption surface, with overlay, text size and line-limit choices. Uses the existing caption extraction/events and capture engine.
+- Added external Tab Groups / Library geometry ownership switches and the owner's Tab Groups recommendation in settings. Updated companion-mod inventory without changing those mods.
+- Added pristine original sources/hashes, reproducible base and input diffs, source mapping, owner-based preference generation, automated checks and a live-browser testing guide.
+
+This build is prepared for testing. Automated DOM/contract tests do not replace live Sine/Zen/Gecko checks; see `TESTING.md` and `docs/VALIDATION.md`.
