+The owner recommends [Tab Groups by oom333](https://github.com/oom333/zen-tab-groups) and uses it with Zentral Groups disabled. Zentral Groups remains available; the Compatibility section can pause its hooks. An external Library-layout switch similarly pauses Extended's experimental Library geometry.
